lack Spot, a curse that will plague your deckbuilding until you finally complete Davy’s quest to kill the mythical mega-whale known as Leviathan. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/e9a014116d93bc22cf2b92f1c8b109c8.poster.avif?t=1780439310\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/e9a014116d93bc22cf2b92f1c8b109c8.webm?t=1780439310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/extras/e9a014116d93bc22cf2b92f1c8b109c8.mp4?t=1780439310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your next favorite roguelike deckbuilder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Davy Jones’ Deckhand is a deckbuilding roguelike with a counter-attack system that turns the genre on its head, promoting precision and careful management of your character's fighting stance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh spin on card combat -</strong> Counter-attacks reward risky last minute parries over tanky defense, making this game like nothing you’ve played before! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game changing loot -</strong> Plunder powerful artefacts that synergise with your custom deck to become an unstoppable terror of the seas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover new weapons -</strong> Each weapon comes with its own starter deck and unique stances, completely changing your playstyle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endlessly replayable -</strong> From the biome you’re travelling through to the deck you build to the weapon you choose, you’ll never experience the same voyage twice. Explore NPC quests or complete gauntlets for an extra brutal challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirates ✅</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Parry and counter-attack your way from lowly deckhand to undead legend – the only deckbuilder where getting hit right is better than not getting hit at all. Master combat stances, perfect-parries, and powerful artefacts to outsmart pirate hordes and break free from Davy’s cursed Black Spot.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/0a24de8d6efa8c3b139bfb86ceabc8638d0b074e/header.jpg?t=1780439310", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/83dc6b1d09eabe3230f60d63177333da4ed36b3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780439310", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544900/83dc6b1d09eabe3230f60d63177333da4ed36b3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780439310", "website": "https://www.cassbaygames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit / Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core CPU (Core i3 6100 or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT1030, 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Cass Bay Games"], "publishers": ["Cass Bay Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 4538750, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support